  "description": "A Rust library providing fundamental data structures for representing and manipulating Context-Free Grammars. It defines an efficient representation for terminals and non-terminals using integer-based indexing and provides facilities for defining production rules and symbol naming. The implementation enables programmatic grammar construction with validation checks for start symbols and variable definitions.",
